<p>---------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>	   Jun     Jul   Aug   Sept    Oct    Nov    Dec    Jan</p>
<p>---------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>1030  0.50/1.50 8/10  19/21  33/35  48/50  62/64  77/79  92/94 1100  0.25/1    8/10  18/20  32/34  47/49  61/64  76/79  91/94</p>
<p>These indicative rates are based on contributions from A Amro, ANZ Grindlays, Andhra Bank, Bank of America, Banque Nationale De Paris, Barclays Bank Ltd, Canara Bank, Citibank, Credit Lyonnais, Deutsche Bank, Dresdner Bank, Global Trust Bank, HDFC Bank, Hongkong Bank, L.C.Raheja, Mashreq Bank,Nucleus Securities, Societe Generale, Standard Chartered Bank, State Bank of India - Calcutta, Syndicate Bank.</p>
